 ==== Go client ====
 
-The [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client|vpsAdmin Go client]] provides
-types for resources, actions and parameters. Add it to your Go module:
+Add the [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client|vpsAdmin Go client]]
+to your Go module:
 
 <code bash>
 go get github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client/client
 </code>
 
-Create the client with ''%%client.New("https://api.vpsfree.cz")%%'' and pass an existing
-token to ''SetExistingTokenAuth''. Use the API origin without a version prefix;
-the generated action paths already include it. See the
-[[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client#usage|client README]] for a complete
-VPS listing example and other action calls.
+Save this example as ''main.go'' and run it with ''go run .'':
+
+<code go>
+package main
+
+import (
+	"fmt"
+	"log"
+
+	"github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client/client"
+)
+
+func main() {
+	api := client.New("https://api.vpsfree.cz")
+	api.SetExistingTokenAuth("TOKEN")
+
+	action := api.Vps.Index.Prepare()
+	action.NewInput().SetLimit(10)
+	response, err := action.Call()
+	if err != nil {
+		log.Fatal(err)
+	}
+	if !response.Status {
+		log.Fatalf("%s: %v", response.Message, response.Errors)
+	}
+
+	for _, vps := range response.Output {
+		fmt.Println(vps.Id, vps.Hostname)
+	}
+}
+</code>
+
+See the [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-go-client#usage|client README]]
+for other actions and parameters.
 
