+The [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-typescript-client|vpsAdmin TypeScript client]]
+provides typed methods for vpsAdmin resources and actions. Install it using npm,
+which also installs its ''haveapi-client'' dependency:
 
 <code bash>
 npm install vpsadmin-typescript-client
 </code>
 
-The [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-typescript-client#readme|client README]]
-describes ''createVpsAdminClient'', authentication and action calls.
+This example works in JavaScript and TypeScript. To run it with Node.js, save it
+as ''vps-list.mjs'' and use ''node vps-list.mjs''.
+Use ''https://api.vpsfree.cz/v7.0'' as the base URL for this client:
+
+<code javascript>
+import { AsyncClient } from "haveapi-client";
+import { createHaveApiExecutor, createVpsAdminClient } from "vpsadmin-typescript-client";
+
+async function main() {
+  const runtime = new AsyncClient("https://api.vpsfree.cz/v7.0");
+  await runtime.authenticate("token", { token: "TOKEN" });
+  const api = createVpsAdminClient({ execute: createHaveApiExecutor(runtime) });
+  const page = await api.vps.index({ params: { limit: 10 } });
+  for (const vps of page.data) {
+    console.log(vps.id, vps.hostname);
+  }
+}
+
+main().catch(console.error);
+</code>
+
+See the [[https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadmin-typescript-client#readme|client README]]
+for other actions and types.
 
